        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pokerchinko is a pachinko game with the added mechanics of trying to make the best poker hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch your ball into the playfield, strategically using enough power to claim a card you need.  There are five tulips.  Land in a tulip and the card on that tulip will be added to your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the top is a spinner that may add some random force to your ball.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pokerchinko is a pachinko game with the added mechanics of trying to make the best poker hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch your ball into the playfield, strategically using enough power to claim a card you need.  There are five tulips.  Land in a tulip and the card on that tulip will be added to your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the top is a spinner that may add some random force to your ball.</p>",
        "short_description": "Pokerchinko is an old-school pachinko game. Your goal is to use your skills of precision to snag the card that makes the best poker hand. The better the hand, the better the rewards. Feel the tension as the balls bounce wildly around the playfield and the exhilaration of landing a fantastic hand.",
